  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>- Substitute into the displacement equation <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x(0) = x_0 \\sin(\\phi)\"></span>: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.045 = 0.090 \\sin(\\phi) \\Rightarrow \\sin(\\phi) = 0.5\"></span> [1 mark]<br/>- Calculate the phase angle, noting that <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v(0) &gt; 0\"></span> requires <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\cos(\\phi) &gt; 0\"></span>: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\phi = \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\approx 0.524\\ \\text{rad}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>- State the equation: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x(t) = 0.090 \\sin(7.00t + 0.524)\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p>- Substitute values into the velocity formula <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v(0) = \\omega x_0 \\cos(\\phi)\"></span>: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v(0) = 7.00 \\times 0.090 \\times \\cos(0.524)\"></span> [1 mark]<br/>- Calculate the result: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v(0) = 0.546\\ \\text{m s}^{-1}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong></p><p>- Calculate the potential energy: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_p = \\frac{1}{2} m \\omega^2 x^2 = 0.5 \\times 0.35 \\times 7.00^2 \\times 0.045^2 = 0.0174\\ \\text{J}\"></span> [1 mark]<br/>- Calculate the kinetic energy: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_k = E_T - E_p = 0.5 \\times 0.35 \\times 7.00^2 \\times (0.090^2 - 0.045^2) = 0.0521\\ \\text{J}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"e\"><p><strong>e</strong></p><p>- Explain that the phase angle determines the starting position and direction of motion at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 0\"></span>, allowing differentiation between systems that are otherwise identical in frequency and amplitude. [1 mark]</p></section>"
  },
